<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>投資家コミュニティ - 前澤ゆうさくの株式投資戦略</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap');
        
        :root {
            --primary: #0B3954;
            --primary-light: #195979;
            --primary-lighter: #2a6d8f;
            --primary-lightest: #3b81a5;
            --primary-dark: #062736;
            --primary-darkest: #021824;
            --primary-bg: rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.03);
            --primary-hover: rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            
            --secondary: #F9A826;
            --secondary-light: #FBBC55;
            --secondary-lighter: #FCD07F;
            --secondary-lightest: #FDE4B9;
            --secondary-dark: #E6940E;
            --secondary-darkest: #C27A0B;
            --secondary-bg: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.05);
            --secondary-hover: rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2);
        }
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
        }
        
        html, body {
            overflow-x: hidden;
            color: var(--primary);
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            line-height: 1.6;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        
        /* アニメーション */
        @keyframes float {
            0% {
                transform: translateY(0px);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-10px);
            }
            100% {
                transform: translateY(0px);
            }
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.7);
            }
            70% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0);
            }
            100% {
                transform: scale(1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(249, 168, 38, 0);
            }
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(20px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        
        /* レイアウト */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        section {
            padding: 80px 0;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        /* ヘッダーセクション */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, var(--primary-bg) 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .hero-pattern {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(var(--primary) 1px, transparent 1px),
                radial-gradient(var(--primary) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 50px 50px;
            background-position: 0 0, 25px 25px;
            opacity: 0.03;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        
        .hero-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background-color: var(--primary-lightest);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .hero-title {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .hero-title span {
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .hero-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: var(--primary-light);
            max-width: 600px;
        }
        
        .limited-offer {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: var(--secondary-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--secondary);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--secondary-dark);
            margin-top: 20px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        .hero-image {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .hero-image img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
            border: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
        }
        
        .image-dots {
            position: absolute;
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            background-image: radial-gradient(var(--secondary) 2px, transparent 2px);
            background-size: 15px 15px;
            top: -20px;
            left: -20px;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.3;
        }
        
        .image-box {
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .image-accent {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -20px;
            right: -20px;
            width: 70%;
            height: 70%;
            background-color: var(--secondary-bg);
            border: 2px solid var(--secondary-lighter);
            border-radius: 20px;
            z-index: -1;
        }
        
        /* ボタンスタイル */
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.15);
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.2);
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.2);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: var(--secondary-light);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn i {
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        
        .btn::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: -100%;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent);
            transition: left 0.7s ease;
        }
        
        .btn:hover::before {
            left: 100%;
        }
        
        /* 特徴セクション */
        .features {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .features::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%, var(--primary-bg) 0%, transparent 60%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 10% 90%, var(--secondary-bg) 0%, transparent 60%);
            z-index: 0;
        }
        
        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--primary);
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80px;
            height: 4px;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        
        .section-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--primary-light);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .feature-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            height: 100%;
        }
        
        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--primary-lighter);
        }
        
        .feature-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 4px;
            height: 100%;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .feature-card:hover::before {
            opacity: 1;
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .feature-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .feature-description {
            color: var(--primary-light);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        
        .features-image {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .features-image img {
            max-width: 80%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            border: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
        }
        
        /* コミュニティの価値セクション */
        .value {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .value-pattern {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        
        .value .section-title {
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        
        .value .section-title::after {
            background-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .value .section-description {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }
        
        .value-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .value-card {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            height: 100%;
        }
        
        .value-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .value-number {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            color: var(--primary-dark);
            border-radius: 50%;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 40px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .value-title {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        
        .value-description {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
        }
        
        .value-highlight {
            color: var(--secondary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .value-image {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 60px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .value-image img {
            max-width: 80%;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            border: 4px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }
        
        /* 社会的証明セクション */
        .testimonials {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .testimonials::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, var(--primary-bg) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 90% 90%, var(--secondary-bg) 0%, transparent 50%);
            z-index: 0;
        }
        
        .testimonials-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .testimonial-card {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.05);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 1px solid rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            height: 100%;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .testimonial-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .testimonial-avatar {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: var(--primary-bg);
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 3px solid var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .testimonial-avatar img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        
        .testimonial-quote {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--primary);
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .testimonial-quote::before {
            content: '"';
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--secondary-lightest);
            position: absolute;
            top: -20px;
            left: -10px;
            z-index: -1;
            font-family: serif;
        }
        
        .testimonial-author {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .testimonial-role {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--primary-light);
        }
        
        .cta-box {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-top: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(11, 57, 84, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .cta-box::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-bg) 0%, var(--secondary-bg) 100%);
            z-index: -1;
        }
        
        .cta-title {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .cta-description {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--primary-light);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        
        /* フッター */
        .footer {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 60px 0 120px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .footer-pattern {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 20px 20px;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        
        .footer-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .disclaimer {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        
        .disclaimer-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        
        /* 固定CTA */
        .floating-cta {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 20px;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            z-index: 100;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        .floating-cta .btn {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            padding: 16px 30px;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(249, 168, 38, 0.3);
        }
        
        /* レスポンシブデザイン */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-grid, .features-grid, .value-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 40px;
            }
            
            .testimonials-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .feature-title, .value-title {
                font-size: 1.3rem;
            }
            
            .hero-image img, .features-image img, .value-image img {
                max-width: 100%;
            }
            
            .cta-box {
                padding: 30px;
            }
            
            .cta-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .testimonials-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .feature-title, .value-title {
                font-size: 1.2rem;
            }
            
            section {
                padding: 60px 0;
            }
            
            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
            
            .limited-offer {
                width: 100%;
                text-align: center;
            }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            .hero-title {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .feature-title, .value-title {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            
            .cta-title {
                font-size: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .cta-box {
                padding: 25px;
            }
            
            .floating-cta .btn {
                padding: 12px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- ヒーローセクション -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-pattern"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <div class="hero-badge">株式投資コミュニティ</div>
                    <h1 class="hero-title">効果的な投資戦略で<span>市場変動</span>に備える</h1>
                    <p class="hero-description">こんにちは、前澤ゆうさくです。絶えず変化する市場において、効果的な銘柄選択戦略と投資タイミングの把握が不可欠です。私は総合的な資産配分と分散投資戦略をご提供します。私のLINEコミュニティで無料で共有しますので、ぜひご参加ください。</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="opensite()">
                        <i class="fab fa-line"></i> 無料でLINEコミュニティに参加
                    </button>
                    <div class="limited-offer">
                        <i class="fas fa-fire"></i> 残り30名限定の無料枠
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-image">
                    <div class="image-box">
                        <div class="image-dots"></div>
                        <img src="https://www.jacmsotck.online/awei-gu415/3/img/1.jpg" alt="前澤ゆうさく - 投資専門家">
                        <div class="image-accent"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- 特徴セクション -->
    <section class="features">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">コミュニティの特徴</h2>
                <p class="section-description">知識共有から実践的な投資戦略まで、私たちのコミュニティがお届けする価値</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">知識共有プラットフォーム</h3>
                    <p class="feature-description">投資知識と基本原則を伝授するための無料のLINEコミュニティを創設しました。メンバーの投資理解力向上を支援します。</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-comments"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">双方向交流の場</h3>
                    <p class="feature-description">コミュニティ内でメンバー同士が自由に意見交換し、投資の洞察や市場観察を共有することで、新たな投資アイデアを生み出せる環境を提供します。</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">リスク管理教育</h3>
                    <p class="feature-description">定期的にセミナーを開催し、メンバーがリスクの特定と管理を学べるよう支援します。安全な投資環境づくりをサポートします。</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-chart-line"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="feature-title">市場理解の促進</h3>
                    <p class="feature-description">ディスカッションを通じて市場動向を分析し、メンバーの市場理解を深め、より賢明な投資判断ができるようサポートします。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="features-image">
                <img src="https://www.jacmsotck.online/awei-gu415/3/img/16.jpg" alt="投資コミュニティの活動">
                
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
